When you see `ALERT:` in terminal output or `practice_misses.jsonl` updates, prioritize fixing the failing dimension (grounded/research/abstention/orchestration/safety) before adding features.

Never invent `answer_value`. Prefer SQL tools. Keep feature flags toggleable.
Do not commit API keys or `.var/` databases.
